            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Berth 1.0.0</h2>
<ul>
<li>A Dock that replaces Apple's: pinned and running apps, badges, drag to pin and reorder, and a menu with each app's windows. Apple's Dock keeps running hidden and comes back exactly as it was whenever Berth quits.</li>
<li>Drop anything onto the Dock: files, folders, images, text and links land on a shelf you can drag back out.</li>
<li>Live window previews when you rest on a running app, with pinch to zoom.</li>
<li>Presets: each with its own pinned apps and shelf, switched from a right-click on empty Dock space.</li>
<li>Solid look in any colour with an optional light, or Glass. Dock on any edge of the screen, Finder and Trash optional.</li>
<li>Guided onboarding with optional permissions. English and Spanish.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
